    {
      "id": 801029,
      "type": "Talent",
      "name": { "en": "Faces of Elation ★ Plot Armor", "zh-CN": "欢愉万相★主角光环" },
      "description": {
        "en": "When the Path of Elation ascends, the Ultimate's CRIT DMG boost effect additionally increases by #1[i]% and applies to all allies. Before the Ultimate triggers Aeon ★ Aha's Elation Skill, additionally triggers one instance of the Trailblazer's Elation Skill. And the DMG multiplier of this Elation Skill increases by #2[i]% of its original value, and is calculated based on the highest value of \"Party Trick\" held by ally characters. For the Aeon ★ Aha's Elation Skill triggered afterward, its True DMG is instead calculated as #3[i]% of the DMG dealt by the aforementioned Trailblazer's Elation Skill, and is distributed evenly among all enemies.",
        "zh-CN": "当「欢愉」命途升格时，终结技的暴击伤害提高效果额外提高#1[i]%，并对我方全体生效。终结技触发星神★阿哈的欢愉技前，额外触发一次开拓者的欢愉技，本次欢愉技的伤害倍率提高原倍率的#2[i]%，并基于我方角色持有的【绝活共赏】最高值进行计算。随后触发的星神★阿哈欢愉技，其真实伤害改为按上述开拓者欢愉技造成伤害的#3[i]%计算，由敌方全体均分。"
      },
      "params": [[0.2, 2, 0.2], [0.3, 3, 0.2]],
      "icon": "icon/skill/8010_aha.png",
      "maxLevel": 2,
      "summary": {
        "en": "When the Path of Elation ascends, the CRIT DMG boost effect provided by the Ultimate additionally increases and applies to all allies. Before the Ultimate triggers Aeon ★ Aha's Elation Skill, additionally triggers one instance of the Trailblazer's Elation Skill. And the DMG multiplier of this Elation Skill increases, and is calculated based on the highest value of \"Party Trick\" held by ally characters. For the Aeon ★ Aha's Elation Skill triggered afterward, its True DMG is instead calculated based on the DMG dealt by the aforementioned Trailblazer's Elation Skill, and is distributed evenly among all enemies.",
        "zh-CN": "当「欢愉」命途升格时，终结技提供的暴击伤害提高效果额外提高，并对我方全体生效。终结技触发星神★阿哈的欢愉技前，额外触发一次开拓者的欢愉技，本次欢愉技的伤害倍率提高，并基于我方角色持有的【绝活共赏】最高值进行计算。随后触发的星神★阿哈欢愉技，其真实伤害改为基于上述开拓者欢愉技造成的伤害计算，由敌方全体均分。"
      },
      "typeText": { "en": "Innate Trace", "zh-CN": "固有行迹" },
      "targetText": { "en": "Enhance", "zh-CN": "强化" }
    }
